PodMouse's pointer mapping and smoothing (Sources/PodMouseCore/Pointer.swift) are
based on AirCursor's, and it learned two more techniques from it and reimplemented them:
playing silent audio to keep AirPods motion flowing (Sources/PodMouse/SilentAudio.swift)
and claiming Now Playing to receive stem presses (Sources/PodMouse/StemControls.swift).

